Third-party software
--------------------

QuestMaster imports the following packages on chain. They are not copied into
this repository; they are deployed on Gno.land and imported from the chain.
They come from github.com/gnolang/gno and remain under their own licence, the
GNO Network General Public License, version 6, including its attribution
terms. QuestMaster's Apache 2.0 licence does not relicense them.

  - gno.land/p/nt/avl/v0              (sorted tree used for storage)
  - gno.land/p/moul/txlink/v0         (gnoweb transaction links)
  - gno.land/p/nt/markdown/sanitize/v0 (Markdown escaping)
  - the Gno standard library (chain, chain/banker, chain/runtime, strings, ...)

Source and licence: https://github.com/gnolang/gno (see LICENSE.md there)
and https://gno.land/license.

